     "plain_text": " runs after Presentation Day. It doesn't count toward your grade \u2014 it's a technical support session for concrete questions about your own build. A retrieval that isn't ranking the way you'd expect, a system prompt that keeps drifting, a tool call that silently drops. Bring the Chatflow and specific problems, not general questions.",
